      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "21",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Likulu liyia neshialo eshiyia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana ndalola likulu liyia nende eshialo eshiyia; okhuba likulu liambeli neshialo shiambeli biali nibihweeleho; myanza nayo bulaano yibulaho. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Khandi ndalola litookho litakatifu, Yerusalemu liyia, niliikha okhurula mwikulu ewaNyasaye, niliirecheeshe shinga omweha owisiayiile omusaatsawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimbulila omwoyo omukhongo okurula mushifumbi shioburuchi, nikusunga mbu Lole, eshimenyo shiaNyasaye shili mubandu, naye alamenyanga mubo; balabeetsanga abandube, ne Nyasaye omwene alaba ninabo halala, naba Nyasaye wabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aleeya amasika kosi mumoni tsiabwe; kata okhufwa shikhulabaho khandi ta; kata shikhulabaho okhwikhuula, kata okhulila, kata okhusaalila khandi tawe; ako akaranjilila kahweele.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.4"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne owali niyeekhaale khushifumbi shioburuchi niyaboola, ari Lola, engalula biosi bibe ebiyia. Nasunga mbu Handiika; okhuba amakhuwa kano nameesiikwa khandi akatoto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyamboolela ari Kamalile okhwikhola. Nisie Alifa nende Omega, obuchaachilo nende obumaliilishi. Oyo owa obuloho bulia, ndalamuheelesia butswa akokhusebele yamatsi kobulamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo ouhula alalaamilwa bino; nasi ndalaba Nyasayewe, naye alaba omwana wanje. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Habula abo abarii, nabo ababula obusuubili, nabeshisinyo, nabeeri, nabaheyi, nabafila, nabeenamili bebifwanani, nende ababeeyi bosi, omukabo kwabwe kulanyooleshela munyanza yomulilo namalsie keshiberiti eyiyiitsanga, nikhwo okhufwa khwakhabili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yerusalemu liyia",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana mulala owokhubamalaika abo musaafu abali nibali nende tsindaabo musaafu etsieetsulakhwo amanyasio ako musaafu akahelelesia, niyeetsa; nasungana ninasi, ari Yitsa, ekhumanyie omweha, omukhasi weLikondi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niyanjmga muRoho, niyambila mushikulu eshikhongo eshirambi, niyamanyia litookho litakatifu lieYerusalemu niliikha okhurula mwikulu ewaNyasaye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "nilili noluyali lwaNyasaye; okhwakha khwalio khweengana lichina liobukusi obutinyu, shinga lichina liayasepi, elieleleshe shinga ibarafu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olukoba lwalio lwali olukhongo olurambi; lwalikhwo ebilibwa ekhumi nabibili; ne habilibwa ebio baliho abamalaika ekhumi nababili; khandi ameera kahandiikwakhwo, aketsimbia ekhumi natsibili etsiabaana baIsiraeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Elubeka Iwebukwe bialiho ebilibwa bitaru; elubeka Iwesautsi, ebilibwa bitaru; khandi elubeka lwamumbo, ebilibwa bitaru. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olukoba Iwelitookho lwali namachina ekhumi nakabili akomuse; ne khuko kalikhwo ameera ekhumi nakabili kabarume beLikondi abo ekhumi nababili.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ne oyo owali nasungananga ninasi yali neshichelo eshifwana shinga litlmdu lieitsahaabu, eshiokhuchela litookho nebilibwa bialio nolukoba lwalio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Obuumbashi bwelitookho elo, tsimbeka tsialio tsine tsiahelana; oburambi bwalio bwahelana nobuchiikha; mana yachela litookho nelitundu, tsimailo eshikhumila ebikhumi biraano; oburambinobuchiikhanobuchmguukhu nibihelana biosi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana nachela olukoba lwalio, emikhono eshikhumi amakhumi kane nachine mukhuchela khwomundu, shichila nibio ebia malaika yeekhoonyela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Olukoba Iwene Iwoombashilwa amachina kayasepi; nalio litookho liali lieitsahaabu inzeleleshe, shinga eshihoo eshieleleshe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Amachina komuse kwolukoba Iwelitookho kali nikang'oonelwa amachina kobukusi obutinyu, tsimbia tsiako tsiosi. Lichina liomuse liambeli liali eliayasepi; eliakhabili, isapiri; eliakhataru, kalekedoni; eliakhane, itsumaridi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "eliakharaano, saridoniki; eliakhasasaba, akiki; eliomusaafu, kirisolito; eliomunaane, sabarajadi; eliashienda, yakuti; eliekhumi, kirisopuraso; eliekhumi nalulala, hiakinitso; eliekhumi nakhabili, ametsisito. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebilibwa ebio ekhumi nabibili biali tsilulu ekhumi natsibili, buli shilala khubilibwa ebio nishili ilulu ndala. Injila yelitookho nayo yali yeitsahaabu inzeleleshe, shinga eshihoo eshing'inang'inu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Shindalolakhwo ihekalu yosi yosi mubwenomwo ta; okhuba Omwami Nyasaye Ounyalabiosi nende Likondi nibo ihekalu yalio. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kata litookho elo shiliakheenya eliuba kata omwesi bililangaalile ta; okhuba oluyali lwaNyasaye lwalilangaalila; ne itaha yalio neLikondi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nako amahanga kalachendelanga mubulafu bwalio, abaruchi abomushialo nibaleeramwo oluyali lwabwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebilibwa bialio shibileekalungwakhwo mushiteere ta--ne eshilo shishilabayo tawe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oluyali neifuma yamahanga balaleerangamwo; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "REV 21:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ne eshindu shiosi eshiomusilo shishileenjila; khwomwo ta, kata oyo oukholanga akeshisinyo nobubeeyi tawe; habula abo bonyene abahandiikwa mushitabu shiobulamu shieLikondi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "REV.21.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "REV.21.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
